  "social-automation__california":
    "California social automation builds are dominated by LA-area DTC brands, influencer agencies and Bay Area B2B SaaS using LinkedIn for ABM outreach. LA brings the IG-and-TikTok-heavy stack — auto-DM responder for new followers, story-mention auto-repost, comment-keyword triggers feeding into Klaviyo or GHL. We ship a meta-business-suite + Manychat + n8n stack tuned for LA wellness, fashion and DTC. Bay Area B2B brings LinkedIn-Sales-Navigator + Phantombuster + HubSpot pipelines focused on ABM list enrichment, weekly touchpoint sequencing and meeting-booking. California has the toughest social-platform compliance environment because of the platforms' own LA-headquartered enforcement teams plus CCPA — we configure rate limits and rotation aggressively to keep accounts un-flagged. SF and Sacramento bring fewer social automation asks and more revops work. Average California social automation build: $1.8K fixed-scope, 8-day ship. The state with the highest 'social-savvy' buyer baseline — California clients know what they want and we ship faster as a result.",

